OL,3,GNEWSACold weather payments extend to
OL,4,A105 more homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FEligibility for cold weather payments
OL,7,Ffor households receiving income support
OL,8,Fhas been expanded to an additional 105
OL,9,Fhomes in Jersey.
OL,11,FThe government approved an amendment to
OL,12,Fthe current support scheme which helps
OL,13,Fpeople financially with heating their
OL,14,Fhomes during the colder months.
OL,16,FIt said it would cost up to #21,000 to
OL,17,Fsupport the additional homes.
