OL,3,GNEWSACold weather payments extend to
OL,4,A105 more homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe current payments are available to
OL,7,Fthose with a child under
OL,8,Fthree-years-old, over 65's, people
OL,9,Freceiving level three personal care
OL,10,Fsupport, receiving child personal care
OL,11,Fat level three or receiving 100%
OL,12,Flong-term incapacity allowance.
